Current reality:

| Target        |      QEMU viability | Notes                                                                                                                                                          |
| ------------- | ------------------: | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| ESP32 classic |                Good | Best first target                                                                                                                                              |
| ESP32-C3      |                Good | RISC-V, supported by Espressif QEMU                                                                                                                            |
| ESP32-S3      | Mixed but promising | Espressif docs now list S3 QEMU support, including a virtual RGB panel, but Arduino-ESP32 docs still say QEMU tests only cover ESP32/C3, so expect rough edges |
